{"language": "en", "duration": 50.0, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.82, "text": "So three months ago, I made a huge mistake with my editing workflow.", "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.16, "word": "So"}, {"start": 0.16, "end": 0.4, "word": "three"}, {"start": 0.4, "end": 0.62, "word": "months"}, {"start": 0.62, "end": 0.96, "word": "ago,"}, {"start": 1.38, "end": 1.5, "word": "I"}, {"start": 1.5, "end": 1.68, "word": "made"}, {"start": 1.68, "end": 1.78, "word": "a"}, {"start": 1.78, "end": 2.02, "word": "huge"}, {"start": 2.02, "end": 2.48, "word": "mistake"}, {"start": 2.48, "end": 2.76, "word": "with"}, {"start": 2.76, "end": 2.96, "word": "my"}, {"start": 2.96, "end": 3.24, "word": "editing"}, {"start": 3.24, "end": 3.82, "word": "workflow."}]}, {"start": 4.18, "end": 7.66, "text": "I spent six hours on a single short, and it got 40 views.", "words": [{"start": 4.18, "end": 4.34, "word": "I"}, {"start": 4.34, "end": 4.62, "word": "spent"}, {"start": 4.62, "end": 4.86, "word": "six"}, {"start": 4.86, "end": 5.28, "word": "hours"}, {"start": 5.28, "end": 5.52, "word": "on"}, {"start": 5.52, "end": 5.64, "word": "a"}, {"start": 5.64, "end": 5.88, "word": "single"}, {"start": 5.88, "end": 6.24, "word": "short,"}, {"start": 6.52, "end": 6.62, "word": "and"}, {"start": 6.62, "end": 6.76, "word": "it"}, {"start": 6.76, "end": 6.96, "word": "got"}, {"start": 6.96, "end": 7.32, "word": "40"}, {"start": 7.32, "end": 7.66, "word": "views."}]}, {"start": 8.04, "end": 8.68, "text": "Um 40.", "words": [{"start": 8.04, "end": 8.26, "word": "Um"}, {"start": 8.26, "end": 8.68, "word": "40."}]}, {"start": 9.06, "end": 11.88, "text": "That is the moment I decided to completely fix my process.", "words": [{"start": 9.06, "end": 9.14, "word": "That"}, {"start": 9.14, "end": 9.26, "word": "is"}, {"start": 9.26, "end": 9.4, "word": "the"}, {"start": 9.4, "end": 9.62, "word": "moment"}, {"start": 9.62, "end": 9.82, "word": "I"}, {"start": 9.82, "end": 10.24, "word": "decided"}, {"start": 10.24, "end": 10.44, "word": "to"}, {"start": 10.44, "end": 10.82, "word": "completely"}, {"start": 10.82, "end": 11.28, "word": "fix"}, {"start": 11.28, "end": 11.48, "word": "my"}, {"start": 11.48, "end": 11.88, "word": "process."}]}, {"start": 14.14, "end": 18.44, "text": "The first thing that changed everything is that I stopped starting my videos with an", "words": [{"start": 14.14, "end": 14.24, "word": "The"}, {"start": 14.24, "end": 14.46, "word": "first"}, {"start": 14.46, "end": 14.78, "word": "thing"}, {"start": 14.78, "end": 14.96, "word": "that"}, {"start": 14.96, "end": 15.36, "word": "changed"}, {"start": 15.36, "end": 15.86, "word": "everything"}, {"start": 15.86, "end": 16.48, "word": "is"}, {"start": 16.48, "end": 16.62, "word": "that"}, {"start": 16.62, "end": 16.72, "word": "I"}, {"start": 16.72, "end": 17.06, "word": "stopped"}, {"start": 17.06, "end": 17.46, "word": "starting"}, {"start": 17.46, "end": 17.68, "word": "my"}, {"start": 17.68, "end": 18.08, "word": "videos"}, {"start": 18.08, "end": 18.34, "word": "with"}, {"start": 18.34, "end": 18.44, "word": "an"}]}, {"start": 18.44, "end": 18.72, "text": "intro.", "words": [{"start": 18.44, "end": 18.72, "word": "intro."}]}, {"start": 19.06, "end": 20.66, "text": "No more hey guys, welcome back.", "words": [{"start": 19.06, "end": 19.26, "word": "No"}, {"start": 19.26, "end": 19.44, "word": "more"}, {"start": 19.44, "end": 19.62, "word": "hey"}, {"start": 19.62, "end": 19.88, "word": "guys,"}, {"start": 20.16, "end": 20.34, "word": "welcome"}, {"start": 20.34, "end": 20.66, "word": "back."}]}, {"start": 20.98, "end": 23.92, "text": "I just start mid-sentence with the most interesting part.", "words": [{"start": 20.98, "end": 21.06, "word": "I"}, {"start": 21.06, "end": 21.28, "word": "just"}, {"start": 21.28, "end": 21.66, "word": "start"}, {"start": 21.66, "end": 21.9, "word": "mid"}, {"start": 21.9, "end": 22.42, "word": "-sentence"}, {"start": 22.42, "end": 22.8, "word": "with"}, 